<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<chapter xml:id="ch-probability" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Probability</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      Probability measures how likely an event is to occur.
      It is a number between 0 (impossible) and 1 (certain).
      This chapter covers experimental and theoretical probability, and combined events.
    </p>
  </introduction>

  <xi:include href="sp01_probability-basics.ptx" />
  <xi:include href="sp02_combined-events.ptx" />

</chapter>
